    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷诺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "ECRA is the institute that researches '^0000FFEnergy Crystals^000000' that shall be used as an alternative energy source in the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom, which suffers from a shortage of energy.",
      "translation" : "卢恩-米德加兹王国能源短缺，因此我们ECRA致力于研究可作为替代能源的^0000FF能量结晶^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The reason for doing this?",
      "translation" : "为什么要这样做？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷诺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I would like to explain that we are not trying to make an excuse to get away from facing problem before I explain the reason. Never! So please let me finish.",
      "translation" : "在说明原因之前，我想先澄清，我们绝不是想找借口逃避问题！请听我把话说完。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷诺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Research Team has sent me the results they found.",
      "translation" : "研究团队把他们的研究结果送来了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷诺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Energy Crystals turned out to be ^0000FFgenerated inside the bodies of some monsters^000000, and according to the research, stronger monsters generate higher-class energy crystals in their bodies.",
      "translation" : "研究发现，能量结晶会^0000FF在某些魔物体内生成^000000。根据研究，魔物越强，体内生成的能量结晶等级就越高。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷诺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Research Team decided to collect Energy Crystals by giving requests to adventurers, with appropriate rewards. That enables us to collect better and be more ^FF0000efficient^000000.",
      "translation" : "研究团队决定委托冒险者收集能量结晶，并给予相应报酬。这样既能提高收集效率，也能让我们^FF0000更有效地^000000开展研究。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷诺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Energy Crystals, accumulated through hunting monsters by my request, shall be used for my research. ^0000FFSome of them are planned to be returned to adventurers.^000000",
      "translation" : "通过我发布的委托狩猎魔物所收集的能量结晶，将用于研究。^0000FF其中一部分计划返还给冒险者。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷诺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Adventurers can use collected Energy Crystals for ^FF0000upgrading equipments^000000 through me.",
      "translation" : "冒险者可以通过我使用收集到的能量结晶^FF0000升级装备^000000。"
